@startuml Namespace Deletion Flow

title Namespace Deletion Flow with ConsistentListFromCache Impact

actor "kubectl" as K
participant "API Server" as API
participant "Namespace Controller" as NC
participant "Namespace Deleter" as ND
participant "CacheDelegator" as CD
participant "Watch Cache" as WC
participant "etcd" as ETCD
participant "Discovery Client" as DC

== Deletion Request ==

K -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns
API -> API: Set deletionTimestamp
API -> ETCD: Update namespace with deletionTimestamp
ETCD --> WC: Watch event (namespace updated)
API --> K: 200 OK (deletion started)

== Namespace Controller Processing ==

WC -> NC: Namespace event (deletionTimestamp set)
NC -> NC: Enqueue namespace for processing
NC -> ND: Delete(ctx, "test-ns")

== Resource Discovery Phase ==

ND -> DC: discoverResourcesFn()
DC -> API: GET /api/v1
API -> CD: GetList(key="", opts={ResourceVersion=""})

note over CD: ConsistentRead=true\n(ResourceVersion="")

CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
note right: **IOPS +1**
ETCD --> CD: currentRV=1000

CD -> WC: notFresh(1000)?
WC --> CD: false (cache is fresh)

CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(1000)
WC --> CD: Core API resources
CD --> API: API resource list
API --> DC: Core resources discovered

DC -> API: GET /apis
API -> CD: GetList(key="/apis", opts={ResourceVersion=""})

note over CD: Another ConsistentRead

CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
note right: **IOPS +1**
ETCD --> CD: currentRV=1001

CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(1001)
WC --> CD: Extension API resources
CD --> API: Extension API resources
API --> DC: All APIs discovered

DC --> ND: Complete resource list:\n- secrets, configmaps, pods,\n- services, deployments, etc.

== Resource Deletion Loop ==

loop For each resource type (GVR)
    
    note over ND: Processing secrets first\n(highest volume in your cluster)
    
    ND -> API: LIST /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets
    API -> CD: GetList(key="/secrets", opts={ResourceVersion=""})
    
    note over CD: ConsistentRead=true
    
    CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
    note right: **IOPS +1**\nPer resource type
    ETCD --> CD: currentRV=1002
    
    CD -> WC: notFresh(1002)?
    WC --> CD: true (cache behind due to ongoing deletions)
    
    CD -> ETCD: RequestWatchProgress()
    note right: **IOPS +1**\nForce cache update
    ETCD --> WC: Progress notification
    WC -> WC: Update resourceVersion=1002
    
    CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(1002)
    WC --> CD: Secret list (e.g., 1000 secrets)
    
    note over WC: **Cache fetch count++**\n(contributes to your 198K metric)
    
    CD --> API: Secret list
    API --> ND: 1000 secrets to delete
    
    == Bulk Secret Deletion ==
    
    alt deleteCollection supported
        ND -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets\n(deleteCollection)
        API -> ETCD: Bulk delete secrets
        note right: **IOPS +1**\nBulk operation
        ETCD --> WC: Multiple watch events
        WC -> WC: Invalidate cache entries
        API --> ND: Deletion initiated
        
    else deleteCollection not supported
        loop For each secret (1000x)
            ND -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets/secret-N
            API -> ETCD: Delete individual secret
            note right: **IOPS +1000**\nIndividual deletions
            ETCD --> WC: Watch event (secret deleted)
            WC -> WC: Invalidate cache entry
            API --> ND: Secret deleted
        end
    end
    
    == Verification Phase ==
    
    ND -> API: LIST /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets\n(verify deletion)
    API -> CD: GetList(key="/secrets", opts={ResourceVersion=""})
    
    note over CD: Another ConsistentRead
    
    CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
    note right: **IOPS +1**
    ETCD --> CD: currentRV=2002 (much higher after deletions)
    
    CD -> WC: notFresh(2002)?
    WC --> CD: true (cache way behind)
    
    CD -> ETCD: RequestWatchProgress()
    note right: **IOPS +1**
    
    alt Cache catches up
        ETCD --> WC: Progress notification
        WC -> WC: Process queued delete events
        CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(2002)
        WC --> CD: Empty secret list
        note over CD: **Success: served from cache**
        
    else Cache timeout (likely scenario)
        note over CD: TooLargeResourceVersion error\nCache can't catch up
        CD -> ETCD: GetList(fallback)
        note right: **IOPS +1**\nFallback query
        ETCD --> CD: Empty secret list (direct from etcd)
        note over CD: **Fallback: direct etcd query**
    end
    
    CD --> API: Verification result
    API --> ND: Secrets deleted successfully
    
end

== Other Resource Types ==

note over ND: Repeat similar pattern for:\n- configmaps, services, pods, etc.\n\nEach follows same ConsistentRead pattern

loop For configmaps, services, pods, etc.
    ND -> API: LIST /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/{resource}
    note over CD: ConsistentRead + potential fallback
    ND -> API: DELETE {resources}
    ND -> API: LIST (verification)
    note over CD: More ConsistentReads + fallbacks
end

== Finalizer Removal ==

ND -> API: GET /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns
API -> CD: Get(key="/namespaces/test-ns")
CD -> WC: GetByKey("/namespaces/test-ns")
WC --> CD: Namespace object
CD --> API: Namespace with finalizers

ND -> API: PUT /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns\n(remove kubernetes finalizer)
API -> ETCD: Update namespace (remove finalizer)
note right: **IOPS +1**
ETCD --> WC: Watch event (namespace updated)
API --> ND: Finalizer removed

== Final Deletion ==

NC -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns\n(final deletion)
API -> ETCD: Delete namespace object
note right: **IOPS +1**
ETCD --> WC: Watch event (namespace deleted)
API --> NC: Namespace deleted

== IOPS Impact Summary ==

note over API: **Total IOPS Breakdown:**\n\n**Discovery Phase:**\n- Core API discovery: +2 IOPS\n- Extension API discovery: +2 IOPS\n\n**Per Resource Type (×N types):**\n- Initial LIST: +2 IOPS (RV check + progress)\n- Deletion: +1-1000 IOPS (bulk vs individual)\n- Verification: +2-3 IOPS (RV check + progress + fallback)\n\n**Your Cluster (secrets dominant):**\n- 198K+ cache operations\n- High fallback rate due to cache thrashing\n- 3-4x IOPS amplification\n\n**Root Cause:**\nConsistentListFromCache + High secret volume\n+ Rapid cache invalidation = IOPS storm

@enduml 